  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> enter two or more heights above to see them side by side at true scale. For reference, the average U.S. man is <strong>5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;9&nbsp;in (175&nbsp;cm)</strong> and the average woman <strong>5&nbsp;ft&nbsp;3.5&nbsp;in (161&nbsp;cm)</strong>, a gap of about 5.4&nbsp;inches.</p></div>

